<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28827" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσδια-φόρητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hard to disperse</i> or
				<i>dissipate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.119
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hardly evaporating</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				10.657
			</span></i>; <i>not excreting readily</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				17(1).188
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάθεσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Trall.
					8.2
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσδιαχώρητος</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
